// ((x << 10) + o, (y << 10) + o), o = ((byte [f_tab_buildItems_4c26b0+0x10 + 20 k] << 10) - 0x400) / 2 + 0x200. Kind 5 with a
// positive dword +8 (n) writes the name at g_golferPhrases+0x19a03 + 37 n plus the string f_strpool_4c68dc and, at zoom 4 with
// bits 0x30 of ([F+0x28] + date) clear, draws it and the string f_strpool_4c64a8+0x42c below. Other kinds write
// f_strpool_4c6980+0x28 / f_strpool_4c6980+0x20 (state [g_objectTypeLevel + 4 k] == 2 / 3, kinds 6 and 8 up) and the name at
// f_tab_buildItems_4c26b0 + 20 k, drawn for kinds >= 6 whose byte +7 lacks bit 0x40 (colour 80007d08 when bit 3 of
// ([F+0x18] + date) is set, else 80006000).
void P4_objectLabel(u32 F) {
